WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.780
Start with the home page
Albums, music picks, artists and a quick link to Liked Songs share one home.

2
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:25.010
Browse the catalogue
Albums, artists and songs have their own views; paging exposes the rest of the catalogue.

3
00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:38.740
Search songs, albums and artists
The same query can be narrowed to each kind of music result.

4
00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:46.480
Search people and recover from no results
People results open profiles, and an empty query result offers a useful next step.

5
00:00:46.480 --> 00:01:03.980
Hear the album play
Playback starts progressively, with ordered tracks and separate performer credits.

6
00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:17.180
Control the listening session
Volume and mute affect the captured sound; shuffle and repeat expose their active states.

7
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:31.320
Queue and navigate without stopping
Queue actions and album/artist links use the same player state.

8
00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:40.400
Listen on a phone
The mobile player keeps progress visible and expands into full listening controls.

9
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:53.710
Navigate without a desktop sidebar
The phone menu opens the same library, search and discovery destinations.
